.TH RANMA-PANES 1 "" "ranma 0.1.0" "ranma manual"
.SH NAME
ranma\-panes \- List every pane in every session: id, where it is, what runs in it
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBranma panes\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List every pane in every session: id, where it is, what runs in it
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
As JSON, one object per pane, for scripts
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBranma\fR(1)
